/E (Background :  Fired heaters are critical in refineries, but over time, ash, unburned hydrocarbons, and foreign matter build up on the convection tubes, reducing heat transfer. The convection section is difficult to clean due to tight spacing, tube arrangement, and access issues. Liquid fuels cause more deposits than gas fuels, increasing the fouling risk.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
